   "source": [
    "# DSC2107 Group 9 – Allbirds (Shopify) Scraper\n",
    "Source: `https://www.allbirds.com/products.json` (public Shopify JSON feed, no login).\n",
    "**Approach:** call the JSON endpoint directly instead of parsing HTML – it is the same data the storefront uses, is structured, and needs far fewer requests.\n",
    "\n",
    "Pipeline: robots.txt check → paginated fetch (retry/back-off) → raw JSON/CSV → clean → SQLite (`products`, `variants`, `observations`).\n",
    "Run once a day for 7 days (see last cell for scheduling)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import requests, time, json, re, sqlite3, random, urllib.robotparser\n",
    "from datetime import datetime, timezone\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "\n",
    "BASE = \"https://www.allbirds.com\"\n",
    "FEED = BASE + \"/products.json\"\n",
    "HEADERS = {\"User-Agent\": \"B32907@student.ucu.ac.ug\"}\n",
    "DELAY = (2, 5)          # seconds between requests (rule 4b)\n",
    "MAX_REQUESTS = 1000     # daily cap\n",
    "PAGE_SIZE = 250         # Shopify max\n",
    "RAW_DIR = Path(\"raw\"); RAW_DIR.mkdir(exist_ok=True)\n",
    "DB_PATH = \"allbirds.db\""
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. robots.txt check (document the output in your recon note)"
   ]
  },
  {
